  "row2_raw_and_strat": "BETWEEN-TRAINING-SEED SE ON THE DIFFERENCE: sd of the paired per-seed deltas / sqrt(n_seeds).",
  "row2_binomial": "SAMPLING FLOOR of the pooled block rate. NOT an error bar on the effect.",
